  introMessage: '<b>Welcome to the Brain Dissection Lab</b>


    Your goal is to
    explore and understand the major

    regions of the brain by performing a virtual
    dissection.


    <b>Procedure:</b>

    1. Equip gloves

    2. Use the dissection
    knife

    3. Separate the hemispheres

    4. Inspect and extract brain regions
    using tweezers'
